{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/concepts/choose-primitive","title":"Which primitive should I use?","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"which-primitive-should-i-use","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Which primitive should I use?"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"There are five primitives. They share the same shape — a name, a configuration,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"optional insertions — and differ only in "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"where the value comes from"}]},{"t":"text","text":" and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"what triggers it"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-decision","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The decision"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Where does the value live?"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Use"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"text","text":"In memory, you own it"}],[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/state/local-state","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"state"}]}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"On a server, read"}],[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/state/server-state","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"query"}]}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"On a server, written"}],[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/state/mutations","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"mutation"}]}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"In the URL's query string"}],[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/state/url-state","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"queryParams"}]}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Nowhere — it's an action with a lifecycle"}],[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/state/async-process","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"asyncProcess"}]}]]]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-same-table-by-symptom","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The same table, by symptom"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"\"I need a value the user can change.\""}]},{"t":"text","text":" → "},{"t":"code","text":"state"},{"t":"text","text":". It is the default. Reach"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"for anything else only when the value's home is somewhere other than memory."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"\"I need to display data from an API.\""}]},{"t":"text","text":" → "},{"t":"code","text":"query"},{"t":"text","text":". It re-runs when its"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"params"},{"t":"text","text":" change and carries "},{"t":"code","text":"isLoading"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"status"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"exception"},{"t":"text","text":" for you. Don't"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"put a "},{"t":"code","text":"query"},{"t":"text","text":" result into a "},{"t":"code","text":"state"},{"t":"text","text":" — that's two sources of truth."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"\"I need to send something to an API.\""}]},{"t":"text","text":" → "},{"t":"code","text":"mutation"},{"t":"text","text":". Triggered explicitly"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"with "},{"t":"code","text":".mutate(...)"},{"t":"text","text":". Connect it back to the read side with"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/state/react-on-mutation","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"insertReactOnMutation"}]},{"t":"text","text":" rather than reloading"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"by hand."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"\"This filter should survive a refresh and be shareable.\""}]},{"t":"text","text":" → "},{"t":"code","text":"queryParams"},{"t":"text","text":"."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"The URL becomes the source of truth; your query's "},{"t":"code","text":"params"},{"t":"text","text":" read from it."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"\"I need to run an async thing and know if it's running.\""}]},{"t":"text","text":" → "},{"t":"code","text":"asyncProcess"},{"t":"text","text":"."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Use it for operations that are not a server read or write: a file export, a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"share sheet, a delay, a Web API call."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"things-that-are-not-a-primitive","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Things that are "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"not"}]},{"t":"text","text":" a primitive"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Derived values"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — use "},{"t":"code","text":"craftComputed"},{"t":"text","text":" inside an insertion. Craft keeps the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"reader dependency visible in the graph."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Reusable logic across primitives"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — that's an"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/concepts/insertions","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"insertion"}]},{"t":"text","text":", not a primitive."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A group of primitives with a name and a scope"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — that's a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/app/craft-service","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"craftService"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-they-have-in-common","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What they have in common"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Whichever you pick, the mechanics are identical: the name comes first, the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"result is the primitive reference itself, "},{"t":"code","text":"yield*"},{"t":"text","text":" drives it inside any"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"craft generator, and the last argument is an insertion."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"That shared shape is one page: "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/concepts/primitive-anatomy","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Anatomy of a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"primitive"}]}]},{"t":"text","text":". Read it once and every"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"primitive page becomes just its own specifics. Advanced patterns that need to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"write a primitive from DI — wrappers, registries, WebMCP tools, seeding a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"query result — use the "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/concepts/primitive-anatomy#injectable-runtime-context","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"injectable runtime"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"context"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"see-also","children":[{"t":"text","text":"See Also"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/concepts/primitive-anatomy","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Anatomy of a primitive"}]}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/01-first-state","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Learn: your first state"}]}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/concepts/insertions","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Insertions"}]}]}]]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"the-decision","text":"The decision"},{"level":2,"id":"the-same-table-by-symptom","text":"The same table, by symptom"},{"level":2,"id":"things-that-are-not-a-primitive","text":"Things that are not a primitive"},{"level":2,"id":"what-they-have-in-common","text":"What they have in common"},{"level":2,"id":"see-also","text":"See Also"}]}